Actually the fix should be to parse the duration first or catch. Let me look at how the upstream Luxon fixed this. I recall the actual fix in Luxon was to use a helper that parses DateTime without throwing, or to check whether the string looks like a duration.

Let me look at the git history / actual fix. The real Luxon fix (PR) changed `fromISO` to:

